amlet.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000004\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"distressing scenes, brief moderate sex\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-09\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":126,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y9Tv9wGPxIw\",\"displayPriority\":1,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000175\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001040\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001087\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002138\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002310\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004702\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004703\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005314\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007765\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012800\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"c566d7dc-50bb-4d55-984b-c4c65751933e\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006677\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008241\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Universal Pictures\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006679\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"28 Years Later: The Bone Temple\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Expanding upon the world created by Danny Boyle and Alex Garland in 28 Years Later - but turning that world on its head - Nia DaCosta directs 28 Years Later: The Bone Temple. In a continuation of the epic story, Dr. Kelson (Ralph Fiennes) finds himself in a shocking new relationship - with consequences that could change the world as they know it - and Spike's (Alfie Williams) encounter with Jimmy Crystal (Jack O'Connell) becomes a nightmare he can't escape. In the world of The Bone Temple, the infected are no longer the greatest threat to survival - the inhumanity of the survivors can be stranger and more terrifying. \\r\\n\\r\\nCUSTOMER NOTICE: This screening is restricted to viewers aged 18 and over. Valid identification must be presented at admission.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Expanding upon the world created by Danny Boyle and Alex Garland in 28 Years Later - but turning that world on its head - Nia DaCosta directs 28 Years Later.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000005\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-16\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":110,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rl_DJZCyEH4\",\"displayPriority\":3,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000313\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001245\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001270\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003206\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004531\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010558\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011257\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011418\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011419\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012645\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012802\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000030\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"ce27f9c4-2b7c-4839-b9e6-0ceceb8e7949\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006679\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008243\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Sony Pictures\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006680\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Rental Family\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"A down-and-out actor living in Tokyo is hired as a token American guy for a Japanese rental-family company, leading him on an unexpected journey of self-discovery through the roles he plays in other people’s lives.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"A down-and-out actor living in Tokyo is hired as a token American guy for a Japanese rental-family company, leading him on an unexpected journey of self-discovery.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000004\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-09\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":103,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sZT37sM2VgE\",\"displayPriority\":4,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004929\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008380\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008381\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010355\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012803\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012804\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012805\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012806\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012807\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\",\"0000000003\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"5675d1e4-8525-4a12-8283-5e88dcc4e188\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006680\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008244\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Walt Disney Studios Motion Pictures - UK\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006686\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"H is for Hawk\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"When Helen's beloved father passes away, she is knocked sideways by grief and loses herself in memories of their time birding and exploring the natural world together. She becomes obsessed with the idea of training her own goshawk, and so she brings the fearsome bird Mabel home to her life as a graduate fellow at Cambridge. Helen fills the freezer with hawk food and turns off her phone, ready to embark on the long, strange business of trying to train this wildest of animals. But as she labours to tame Mabel, a grieving Helen undergoes an untaming of her own. A record of a spiritual journey, H IS FOR HAWK is a story about memory and nature and how it might be possible to reconcile death with life and love.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"When Helen's beloved father passes away, she is knocked sideways by grief and loses herself in memories of their time birding and exploring the natural world together.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000004\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"infrequent strong language, drug misuse, injury detail, sex references\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-23\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":115,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RJ29BBXfN64\",\"displayPriority\":3,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000166\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000167\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000254\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002250\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007943\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012811\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012812\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012813\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012814\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012815\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"e652fb82-1635-4421-a615-6bd0166c8771\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006686\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008251\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Lionsgate\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006689\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"No Other Choice\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"After being unemployed for several years, a man devises a unique plan to secure a new job: eliminate his competition.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"After being unemployed for several years, a man devises a unique plan to secure a new job: eliminate his competition.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-23\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":139,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":1,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012169\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012827\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012828\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012829\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012830\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012831\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\",\"0000000026\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"9ecc0908-a983-42f7-9591-6f8d73d7488b\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006689\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008255\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"MUBI\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006608\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"The Housemaid\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"THE HOUSEMAID is a wildly entertaining thriller starring Sydney Sweeney and Amanda Seyfried, based on the best-selling book. From director Paul Feig, the film plunges audiences into a twisted world where perfection is an illusion, and nothing is as it seems. Trying to escape her past, Millie (Sweeney) accepts a job as a live-in housemaid for the wealthy Nina (Seyfried) and Andrew Winchester (Brandon Sklenar). But what begins as a dream job quickly unravels into something far more dangerous — a sexy, seductive game of secrets, scandal, and power. Behind the Winchesters’ closed doors lies a world of shocking twists that will leave you guessing until the very end.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"THE HOUSEMAID is a wildly entertaining thriller starring Sydney Sweeney and Amanda Seyfried, based on the best-selling book. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong violence, injury detail, sex, sexual violence, very strong language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-12-26\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":131,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjThWa5R8Zw\",\"displayPriority\":2,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"